<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Sapura Motors debuts at 6.3 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Sapura Motors debuts at 6.3 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of Sapura Motors Bhd made their debut on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Friday at 6.3 ringgit against an offer price of 2.1 ringgit.</p>
<p>The auto and metal parts maker offered 9.5 million new shares for listing on the second board of the KLSE.</p>
<p>At the lunch-break, the share was at 5.95 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
